<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South Africa details 1996 minerals production.</title>
<headline>South Africa details 1996 minerals production.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Minerals Bureau detailed 1996 production of certain minerals as follows, in tonnes unless specified:</p>
<p>					 1996	    1995</p>
<p> Gold (kg)			   495,432	 523,815</p>
<p> Platinum group metals (kg)    188,636	 183,097</p>
<p> Copper				152,902	 161,573</p>
<p> Nickel				33,362	  29,803</p>
<p> Chrome ore			  5,000,038     5,086,053</p>
<p> Iron ore			    30,660,276    31,945,511</p>
<p> Manganese ore		     3,254,240     3,198,569</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
